@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam ArrowColor black
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊疗助理" as A
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n诊所负责人" as M
actor "供应商" as V
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
A -> M : 提出材料补充需求
M -> V : 确认采购项目、数量和交付条件
V --> M : 确认供货安排
M -> A : 交接采购明细
loop 每次到货
 V -> A : 交付材料及随货单据
 A -> A : 核对数量、批号、效期和实物
 A -> V : 告知合格、拒收及差异
 V --> A : 确认补货或退换处理
 A -> A : 登记合格入库及未到数量
 A -> M : 报告验收结果和未结事项
end
M -> C : 确认结算依据和付款安排
C -> V : 核对货款并按约定付款
V --> C : 确认款项及凭据
C -> C : 保存原采购、验收及支付依据
@enduml
